content.text:
Now mobile gun layout in guns.update. Modify the position/rotation section:

```
const narrow = camera.aspect < 0.9;
const xFactor = narrow ? 0.55 : 1;
b.group.position.lerpVectors(...);
b.group.position.x *= xFactor;
...
b.group.position.y += narrow ? 0.02 : 0;
```
And group scale:
```
b.group.scale.setScalar(narrow ? 0.58 : 0.66);
```
But `camera` is captured in createWeapons, yes.

Also for touch, hide weapon rig? No, we want it.

Add.

input.oldString:
b.group.position.lerpVectors(bp.pos, ap.pos, adsT);
b.group.position.x += swayX + bobX + sprintTilt * 0.3;
b.group.position.y += swayY + bobY - reloadDip * 0.22 + airDip;
b.group.position.z += recoil * 0.075;

input.newString:
const narrow = camera.aspect < 0.9;
b.group.scale.setScalar(narrow ? 0.56 : 0.66);
b.group.position.lerpVectors(bp.pos, ap.pos, adsT);
b.group.position.x *= narrow ? 0.52 : 1;
b.group.position.x += swayX + bobX + sprintTilt * 0.3;
b.group.position.y += swayY + bobY - reloadDip * 0.22 + airDip + (narrow ? 0.03 : 0);
b.group.position.z += recoil * 0.075;

